{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:v","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"void"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"unregisterForPushNotifications:","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:v","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"void"},{"text":" (^","kind":"text"},{"kind":"text","text":")("},{"text":"NSError","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSError","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" * ","kind":"text"},{"text":"error","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":")) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"completion","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"completion","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Block called when unregistration completes."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Receives nil on success or an NSError on failure.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Removes the device from receiving push notifications:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Notifies Pushwoosh servers to stop sending notifications to this device"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Removes the device token from Pushwoosh"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this when the user logs out, deletes their account, or explicitly disables notifications."}]},{"level":2,"text":"Example","anchor":"Example","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Unregister during user logout:"}]},{"code":["class AuthenticationManager {","","    func logout(completion: @escaping (Result<Void, Error>) -> Void) {","        \/\/ Show loading indicator","        LoadingIndicator.show()","","        \/\/ First, unregister from push to stop receiving notifications for this user","        Pushwoosh.configure.unregisterForPushNotifications { [weak self] error in","            if let error = error {","                Logger.warning(\"Push unregistration failed: \\(error.localizedDescription)\")","                \/\/ Continue with logout even if unregistration fails","            }","","            \/\/ Clear user session","            self?.clearUserSession()","","            \/\/ Clear user tags","            Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","                \"logged_in\": false,","                \"user_id\": NSNull(),","                \"email\": NSNull()","            ])","","            \/\/ Stop server communication if required by privacy policy","            if UserDefaults.standard.bool(forKey: \"clearDataOnLogout\") {","                Pushwoosh.configure.stopServerCommunication()","            }","","            LoadingIndicator.hide()","            completion(.success(()))","        }","    }","","    private func clearUserSession() {","        KeychainManager.shared.clearCredentials()","        UserDefaults.standard.removePersistentDomain(forName: Bundle.main.bundleIdentifier!)","        CoreDataManager.shared.clearUserData()","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"unregisterForPushNotifications:","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"unregisterForPushNotifications:"}],"modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"title":"unregisterForPushNotifications:","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)unregisterForPushNotifications:","roleHeading":"Type Method"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Unregisters the device from push notifications."}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/unregisterForPushNotifications:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/unregisterforpushnotifications:"]}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/unregisterForPushNotifications:":{"title":"unregisterForPushNotifications:","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Unregisters the device from push notifications."}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"unregisterForPushNotifications:","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/unregisterForPushNotifications:","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/unregisterforpushnotifications:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"text":"unregisterForPushNotifications:","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"abstract":[{"text":"Protocol defining SDK configuration methods.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"PWConfiguration","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","fragments":[{"text":"PWConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","kind":"symbol","title":"PushwooshCore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"role":"collection","type":"topic"}}}